      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seems to be a reintroduction of this issue posted two years ago.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/contact-receivers-receive-sender-events-from-the-same-avatar-even-with-allow-sel\n\nI should note that this bug was briefly resolved, only now reappearing in a recent update.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
